==Notes==
*Until [[patch 4.2.0]] to begin the fight you needed to use the [[Key to the Focusing Iris]] or [[Heroic Key to the Focusing Iris]], which dropped from [[Sapphiron]] in [[Naxxramas]] (on 10 and 25-player modes, respectively) once per kill. The Heroic Key started the fight in both the 10-man ''and'' 25-man versions.
*During [[patch 8.2.0]], it was planned to visit the Eye, to investigate an Arcane Prism, defeat its defenses, and defeat an Anomaly of Eternity.

